## 8. Follow-up: years page now defaults to the viewer's own track (commit `4d4b3da`)

Owner question: "but the user choose in first the year and the faculty?" — onboarding
collects filière → faculty → year (the year step filters by track) and stores
facultyId + yearId, but the years page ignored it and listed all 22 years across
every track. Fix (frontend-only):

- Track pills (Médecine / Médecine dentaire / Pharmacie / Toutes les filières),
  defaulting to the track derived from the viewer's own year row; "Toutes" restores
  the full list (also the default for viewers without a year).
- Default sort is now "Ordre du programme" (orderIndex — what the API already
  returns) instead of the alphabetical scramble; az/za/recent remain available.
- Reset-filters returns to the same defaults. i18n keys years.trackFilter /
  years.allTracks / years.sortCurriculum (FR+EN, missing-key tsc guard).
- Gates: tsc 0, lint 0 (4 pre-existing warnings), next build 0.

Post-deploy verification (fresh VERIFY account verify-track-8816@…, onboarding =
faculty alger + Résidanat médecine):
- Default view capture `ev_26227084c21589bd5879ad353f133adec0eef5706893d089404b84bd57a4b4cb`:
