- Console garbling in the DOM dump (MǸdecine, fili��res) is the known codepage-850
  console artifact (handoff §12.2), not a data bug.
- Cleanup proof: DELETE /api/users/me → 200; old token → 401; relaunch login → 401.
- Note: a first default-view capture (`ev_dac3dc28…`) fired before the years fetch
