## Notes / limitations (disclosed)

- The 500s on the Résidanat modules page's own unit/progress calls (40 parallel
  per-module fetches from that page) are a SEPARATE pre-existing pattern
  (`useApiList` fan-out) — not fixed here; cards degrade gracefully (0 leçons ·
  0 unités is truthful for this empty bank). Flagged for a future grouped-count
  pass if it ever shows false data (it currently cannot: those years have no
  lessons/units/progress rows at all).
- MedSpark remains untrusted DATA; nothing was copied from it. This fix is purely
  about Hamame's own years page.


