### Disclosures / limitations
- One repeat capture (ev_5dbe7016…) caught the button mid-load ("Chargement du dernier
  quiz…"); superseded by ev_8d4b5054… which waits for the button to return to idle.
- One capture ended cleanup_incomplete after an MCP restart (browser_transport cleanup
  timed out after 30s). Verified via Win32_Process that no headless/temp-profile
  chrome.exe remained — all running chrome.exe used the owner's own profile. No orphans.
- Two more MCP restarts mid-session dropped the REA tool catalog; every evidence bundle
  had been exported to disk immediately after each capture, so nothing was lost.
- First multi-module capture failed on a Playwright strict-mode wait (locator resolved
  to 20 chips — which incidentally proved the chips rendered); the re-run with
  strict-safe locators is the valid capture.
- Capture C's mid-step screenshot (after a 3s settle) caught the faculty select still
  "Chargement…" — preselect fills only after the faculties list resolves; the final
  at_end screenshot is the valid state.
- DOM dumps show mojibake for accents (codepage-850 console artifact, handoff §12.2);
  judged at byte level, DOM text files written UTF-8.
- React does not serialize `checked`/`selected` into DOM dumps; tick state verified via
  screenshots + network payloads instead.
- Bank discovery: the ONLY populated bank is the seed faculty "Medicine"
  (b37b039e-2208-4837-b5d5-28b1c338a2cf) Year 1 module Cardiology unit Cardiac
  Physiology — 9 approved global questions. All alger years are truly empty (owner's
  choice); anonymous counts probed 0 across every alger year.
- MBset live-UI parity study remains blocked: the owner's password was rejected twice
  (attempts stopped per policy; probe account hamame.probe.7210@example.com stays
  unverified on MBset and cannot be deleted from there). Structure-level study used the
  earlier captures only; no MBset question content was harvested at any point.
